Object.assign(ACC,{"pso1": {"b": "wpscope", "d": {"style": "pso", "L": 375, "L0": 337, "H": 136, "W": 72, "ay": 72, "xa": -16, "rb": 12.5, "ro": 17, "top": 38, "ml": 110}, "slot": "optic", "n": "ПСО-1 / PSO-1 4×24", "k": ["Visor de 4 aumentos (montura lateral del Pacto de Varsovia)", "4× scope (Warsaw Pact side mount)"], "g": 616, "gn": ["visor con su soporte lateral", "sight with its side bracket"], "mm": 375, "dm": {"w": 72, "h": 136}, "note": ["Diseñado para el fusil SVD (retícula calculada para 7,62×54 mm R). Encaja en el mismo raíl lateral, pero no era la mira de dotación de esta arma. Largo 375 mm con ocular de goma y parasol (337 mm sin ellos).", "Designed for the SVD rifle (reticle calibrated for 7.62×54mmR). It fits the same side rail, but it was not this weapon's issue sight. 375 mm long with rubber eyecup and sunshade (337 mm without)."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – ПСО-1 (габаритные размеры 337×136×72 мм; 375 мм с наглазником и блендой; 0,616 кг)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9F%D0%A1%D0%9E-1"], ["Wikipedia – PSO-1 (4×24, objective 24 mm)", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PSO-1"]], "own": 1}, "p29": {"b": "wpscope", "d": {"style": "p29", "L": 203, "L0": 163, "H": 178, "W": 80, "ay": 86, "xa": -14, "rb": 24, "ro": 21, "re": 22, "top": 40, "kl": 24, "ml": 90}, "slot": "optic", "n": "1П29 «Тюльпан» (1P29 Tulip)", "k": ["Visor universal de 4 aumentos (dotación AK-74N y PKMN)", "Universal 4× sight (AK-74N and PKMN issue)"], "g": 800, "mm": 203, "dm": {"w": 80, "h": 178}, "note": ["Diseñado para los AK-74N/AK-74M, RPK-74N, PKMN y Pecheneg; va en el raíl lateral «cola de milano». La fuente da 203×80×178 mm sin decir cuál es el alto; el modelo usa 178 mm de alto (el soporte es alto en las fotos).", "Designed for the AK-74N/AK-74M, RPK-74N, PKMN and Pecheneg; it goes on the dovetail side rail. The source gives 203×80×178 mm without saying which is the height; the model uses 178 mm tall (the bracket is tall in photos)."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – 1П29 (масса 0,8 кг; 203 / 178 / 80 мм; АК-74, АК74Н, ПКМН)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/1%D0%9F29"]], "own": 1}, "p78": {"b": "wpscope", "d": {"style": "p29", "L": 200, "L0": 165, "H": 175, "W": 85, "ay": 86, "xa": -14, "rb": 22, "ro": 19, "re": 20, "top": 38, "kl": 25, "ml": 90}, "slot": "optic", "n": "1П78 «Каштан» (1P78 Kashtan)", "k": ["Visor de 2,8 aumentos (montura lateral)", "2.8× scope (side mount)"], "g": 750, "gn": ["versiones 1P78 y 1P78-2 (la 1P78-1 pesa 0,7 kg)", "1P78 and 1P78-2 versions (the 1P78-1 weighs 0.7 kg)"], "mm": 200, "dm": {"w": 85, "h": 175}, "note": ["Para fusiles de asalto y ametralladoras ligeras con raíl lateral (fabricante: NPZ, Novosibirsk). Medidas 200×85×175 mm (1P78 / 1P78-2).", "For assault rifles and light machine guns with a side rail (maker: NPZ, Novosibirsk). Size 200×85×175 mm (1P78 / 1P78-2)."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – 1П78 (масса 0,7–0,75 кг; длина 200, ширина 85–90, высота 171–175 мм)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/1%D0%9F78_(%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BB)"]], "own": 1}, "kobra": {"b": "wpref", "d": {"L": 144, "W": 66, "H": 144, "ay": 84, "xa": -14, "ww": 46, "wh": 40, "ml": 70}, "slot": "optic", "dot": 0, "n": "Кобра ЭКП-1С-03 (Kobra EKP-1S-03)", "k": ["Colimador 1× (montura lateral del Pacto de Varsovia)", "1× collimator sight (Warsaw Pact side mount)"], "g": 410, "mm": 144, "dm": {"w": 66, "h": 144}, "note": ["Modelo de primera generación de Axion (Izhevsk) con montura lateral para fusiles tipo AK; 4 retículas y 16 niveles de brillo (datos del fabricante citados).", "First-generation Axion (Izhevsk) model with a side mount for AK-pattern rifles; 4 reticles and 16 brightness levels (maker data as cited)."], "src": [["Wikipedia – Kobra sight (tabla con datos del fabricante: EKP-1S-03 410 g, 144×66×144 mm)", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kobra_sight"], ["Axion – colimadores Kobra (fabricante)", "https://kobra.axion.ru/"]], "own": 1}, "obzor": {"b": "wpref", "d": {"L": 133, "W": 68, "H": 152, "ay": 84, "xa": -14, "ww": 48, "wh": 36, "ml": 70, "style": "obzor"}, "slot": "optic", "n": "1П63 «Обзор» (1P63 Obzor)", "k": ["Colimador 1× de dotación (montura lateral)", "Issue 1× collimator sight (side mount)"], "g": 600, "mm": 133, "dm": {"w": 68, "h": 152}, "note": ["Para AKMN, AK-74N, AKS-74N, AK-74M y la serie 100, y RPK con raíl lateral (no para la PKM).", "For the AKMN, AK-74N, AKS-74N, AK-74M and 100 series, and RPKs with a side rail (not the PKM)."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – 1П63 (0,6 кг; 133 × 68 × 152 мм)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/1%D0%9F63"]], "own": 1}, "p87": {"b": "p87", "d": {"L": 135, "W": 68, "H": 72, "ay": 42}, "slot": "optic", "dot": 1, "ay": 42, "n": "1П87 (Valdai)", "k": ["Colimador 1× de dotación del AK-12 (raíl Picatinny)", "AK-12 issue 1× collimator sight (Picatinny rail)"], "g": 300, "gn": ["sin pila (±3 %)", "without battery (±3%)"], "mm": 135, "dm": {"w": 68, "h": 72}, "note": ["Medidas máximas según la documentación técnica reproducida (135×68×72 mm, 0,3 kg ±3 % sin pila).", "Maximum dimensions per the reproduced technical documentation (135×68×72 mm, 0.3 kg ±3% without battery)."], "src": [["ak-info.ru – Прицел коллиматорный 1П87 (габаритные размеры не более 135×68×72 мм; 0,3 кг)", "https://www.ak-info.ru/joomla/index.php/devices/9-optics/216-1p87about"], ["snakeproject.ru – Прицел коллиматорный 1П87 (mismos datos)", "https://snakeproject.ru/rubric/article.php?art=1p87_20052024"]], "own": 1}, "gp25": {"b": "gpl", "d": {"L": 323, "bl": 120, "gy": 55, "r": 25}, "slot": "under", "n": "ГП-25 «Костёр» (GP-25 Koster)", "k": ["Lanzagranadas de 40 mm bajo el cañón", "40 mm underbarrel grenade launcher"], "g": 1500, "gn": ["sin granada (1,76 kg con granada)", "without grenade (1.76 kg loaded)"], "mm": 323, "barrel": 120, "note": ["Se fija al cañón y al tetón de la bayoneta, así que no admite bayoneta a la vez. Diámetro exterior del cañón y alto: sin dato publicado, forma aproximada.", "It clamps to the barrel and the bayonet lug, so no bayonet at the same time. Barrel outer diameter and height: not published, approximate shape."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – ГП-25 (1,5 кг sin granada; 323 mm; cañón 120 mm)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%9F-25"]], "own": 1}, "gp34": {"b": "gpl", "d": {"L": 315, "bl": 120, "gy": 72, "r": 25, "style": "gp34"}, "slot": "under", "n": "ГП-34 (GP-34)", "k": ["Lanzagranadas de 40 mm bajo el cañón", "40 mm underbarrel grenade launcher"], "g": 1400, "gn": ["sin granada", "without grenade"], "mm": 315, "note": ["Kalashnikov lo destina al AK-74M, la serie 100 y el AK-12; los raíles del AK-12 no impiden montarlo. Largo del cañón no publicado: el modelo usa el del GP-25.", "Kalashnikov intends it for the AK-74M, the 100 series and the AK-12; the AK-12's rails don't prevent fitting it. Barrel length not published: the model uses the GP-25's."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – ГП-34 (1,4 kg; 315 mm; AK-12)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%9F-34"], ["Wikipedia (ru) – АК-12 (GP-25/GP-34 bajo el cañón)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%9A-12"]], "own": 1}, "6kh5": {"b": "bayo", "d": {"L": 290, "bl": 160, "bw": 29, "ri": 17.7}, "slot": "under", "n": "Bayoneta 6Х5 (6Kh5)", "k": ["Bayoneta-cuchillo de dotación del AK-74", "AK-74 issue knife bayonet"], "g": 220, "mm": 290, "barrel": 160, "note": ["Largo total 290 mm, hoja 160 × 29 mm, anilla de 17,7 mm de diámetro interior. Ocupa el tetón bajo el cañón, como el GP-25. El AK-12 usa otra (6Х9-1), por eso solo va en el AK-74.", "Overall 290 mm, blade 160 × 29 mm, ring inner diameter 17.7 mm. It uses the lug under the barrel, like the GP-25. The AK-12 uses a different one (6Kh9-1), so it only goes on the AK-74."], "src": [["Wikipedia (ru) – Штык-нож 6Х5 (0,22 kg; 290/160 mm; hoja 29 mm; anilla 17,7 mm)", "https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/6%D0%A55"]], "own": 1}, "nar_t2": {"b": "btnar", "d": {"L": 84, "W": 40, "H": 24, "opt": "micro", "od": {"len": 79, "w": 46, "h": 48, "ay": 20, "sl": 68, "low": 1}}, "slot": "optic", "dot": 1, "ay": 44, "n": "B&T NAR + Aimpoint Micro T-2", "k": ["Montura de garras HK de perfil bajo con punto rojo", "Low-profile HK claw mount with red dot"], "g": 192, "gn": ["montura 62 g + visor con montura estándar 130 g", "mount 62 g + sight with standard mount 130 g"], "mm": 84, "dm": {"w": 46, "h": 72}, "note": ["La montura B&T NAR (84×40×24 mm) se engancha en las ranuras de garras del cajón del MP5 y lleva un raíl Picatinny corto pensado para el Aimpoint Micro.", "The B&T NAR mount (84×40×24 mm) hooks into the MP5 receiver's claw recesses and carries a short Picatinny rail meant for the Aimpoint Micro."], "src": [["B&T (tienda de piezas) – BT-10266 NAR Low Profile Mount (84×40×24 mm)", "https://bt-parts.com/bt-10266-b-t-mounting-rail-nar-low-profile-mount/"], ["Centerfire Reserve – B&T NAR (84 mm, 40 mm, 24 mm, 62 g)", "https://centerfirereserve.com/product/bt-nar-universal-rail-hk-low-profile-optic-mount/"], ["Aimpoint – Micro T-2 with standard mount", "https://www.aimpoint.com/products/micro-t-2-2-moa-red-dot-reflex-sight-with-standard-mount-for-weaver-picatinny/"]], "own": 1}, "ag36": {"b": "ag36", "d": {"L": 350, "bl": 280, "W": 90, "H": 210, "gy": 50, "st": 38, "sw": 22, "hz": 252}, "slot": "under", "n": "HK AG36", "k": ["Lanzagranadas de 40 mm (sustituye al guardamanos)", "40 mm grenade launcher (replaces the handguard)"], "g": 1500, "mm": 350, "barrel": 280, "dm": {"w": 90, "h": 210}, "note": ["Para montarlo se quita el guardamanos del G36 y el AG36 ocupa su lugar. Recámara basculante hacia la izquierda; alza escalonada en el lado izquierdo.", "To fit it, the G36 handguard is removed and the AG36 takes its place. Breech swings out to the left; ladder sight on the left side."], "src": [["Wikipedia – Heckler & Koch AG36 (1,5 kg; 350 mm; cañón 280 mm; 90 × 210 mm)", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heckler_%26_Koch_AG36"]], "own": 1}});
{const PLX={"ak74": {"pso1": {"p": [0.015, 0.071, -0.2]}, "p29": {"p": [0.015, 0.071, -0.14]}, "p78": {"p": [0.015, 0.071, -0.14]}, "kobra": {"p": [0.015, 0.071, -0.12]}, "obzor": {"p": [0.015, 0.071, -0.12]}, "gp25": {"p": [0, 0.0748, 0.44]}, "6kh5": {"p": [0, 0.0748, 0.48]}}, "pkm": {"p29": {"p": [0.0265, 0.105, -0.2]}, "pso1": {"p": [0.0265, 0.105, -0.22]}}, "ak12": {"gp34": {"p": [0, 0.0676, 0.4]}}, "mp5": {"nar_t2": {"p": [0, 0.1218, 0.03]}}, "g36": {"ag36": {"p": [0, 0.0687, 0.45]}}}, AX={"ak74": {"optic": ["p29", "obzor", "kobra", "p78", "pso1"], "under": ["gp25", "6kh5"]}, "pkm": {"optic": ["p29", "pso1"]}, "ak12": {"optic": ["p87", "exps3", "microt2", "hs510c"], "under": ["gp34"]}, "mp5": {"optic": ["nar_t2"], "muzzle": ["bt_smg9"]}, "g36": {"under": ["ag36"]}}, VN={"ak74": ["AK-74 con guardamanos de madera: sin raíles Picatinny. Las miras rusas van en el raíl lateral «cola de milano» del AK-74N/AK-74M; este modelo es un AK-74 sin ese raíl, así que se muestran donde iría. El GP-25 y la bayoneta 6Kh5 usan el tetón bajo el cañón: o uno u otro. Sin silenciador: no hay medidas oficiales publicadas del PBS-4.", "AK-74 with wooden furniture: no Picatinny rails. Russian sights go on the AK-74N/AK-74M dovetail side rail; this model is an AK-74 without that rail, so they are shown where it would be. The GP-25 and the 6Kh5 bayonet both use the lug under the barrel: one or the other. No suppressor: no official dimensions are published for the PBS-4."], "pkm": ["La PKMN lleva el raíl lateral del Pacto de Varsovia en el cajón (no modelado aquí: el visor se muestra donde iría). El 1P29 es su visor diurno de dotación; el PSO-1 encaja en el mismo raíl pero es la mira del SVD. El bípode es parte del arma.", "The PKMN has the Warsaw Pact side rail on its receiver (not modelled here: the sight is shown where it would be). The 1P29 is its issue day sight; the PSO-1 fits the same rail but is the SVD's scope. The bipod is part of the gun."], "ak12": ["El AK-12 trae raíl Picatinny en la tapa del cajón: su colimador de dotación es el 1P87, y también admite miras occidentales. Bajo el cañón, el lanzagranadas GP-34. No hay silenciador de 5,45 mm con medidas oficiales en el Armero.", "The AK-12 has a Picatinny rail on its dust cover: its issue collimator is the 1P87, and it also takes Western sights. Under the barrel, the GP-34 grenade launcher. There is no 5.45 mm suppressor with official dimensions in the Gunsmith."], "mp5": ["El MP5 no tiene raíl Picatinny: las miras van en una montura de garras, aquí la B&T NAR con un Aimpoint Micro T-2. La montura de garras original de HK no se modela porque HK no publica sus medidas. Su cañón de tres tetones admite silenciadores de 9 mm como el B&T QD.", "The MP5 has no Picatinny rail: sights go on a claw mount, here the B&T NAR with an Aimpoint Micro T-2. HK's own claw mount is not modelled because HK publishes no dimensions for it. Its three-lug barrel takes 9 mm suppressors such as the B&T QD."], "g36": ["El G36 estándar lleva su mira doble dentro del asa y no tiene raíles. El lanzagranadas AG36 sustituye al guardamanos (en el modelo lo cubre). Existen asas con raíl, pero este modelo es el fusil de serie.", "The standard G36 has its dual sight inside the carry handle and no rails. The AG36 grenade launcher replaces the handguard (on the model it covers it). Rail handles exist, but this model is the standard rifle."], "l85a2": ["El Ejército británico ha usado en el L85A2 las miras SUSAT, Trijicon ACOG y ELCAN (Wikipedia). Este modelo lleva el guardamanos original sin raíles: sin empuñaduras ni linternas. El lanzagranadas L123 necesita el guardamanos con raíles de Daniel Defense, así que no se monta aquí; la bayoneta L3A1 no se modela porque no hay medidas oficiales publicadas.", "The British Army has used SUSAT, Trijicon ACOG and ELCAN sights on the L85A2 (Wikipedia). This model has the original railless handguard: no grips or lights. The L123 grenade launcher needs the Daniel Defense rail handguard, so it isn't fitted here; the L3A1 bayonet isn't modelled because no official dimensions are published."]};
for(const w of W){ if(VN[w.id]) w.vnote=VN[w.id]; for(const v of w.V){ if(AX[v.id]) v.acc=AX[v.id]; if(PLX[v.id]) v.pl=Object.assign(v.pl||{},PLX[v.id]); } }}
